NOTE ON DATA. This licence covers the code in this repository only.

The hazard datasets fetched by the scripts remain the property of their
publishers and are used under their own terms — principally the Open
Government Licence v3.0 (British Geological Survey, Met Office, Environment
Agency, Natural Resources Wales, SEPA) and CC-BY 4.0 (ECMWF ERA5 via
Open-Meteo). Derived data files committed to this repository are aggregates
of those sources and carry the same obligations: retain the attributions
listed in DATA_SOURCES.md.

This model is a demonstration of methodology. It is not a rating product,
not financial advice, and must not be used to price real insurance risk.
